        <rdfs:comment>Present both in the original file (SWO_0000393) and in the core file (SWO_0000003), and each have different identifiers. SWO_0000393 was initially created within the originalsoftwareontology.owl and later moved to swo_core.owl. SWO_0000003 was retained and SWO_0000393 deemed obsolete. Please use SWO_0000003 instead.</rdfs:comment>
